  <p id="c-sanguozhi-012-cuiyan-qiuxu:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">太祖令曰：『<persName id="c-sanguozhi-012-cuiyan-qiuxu:p001:m0006" ref="i6e_n75_es1">琰</persName>雖見刑，而通賓客，門若市人，對賓客虬鬚直視，若有所瞋。』遂賜<persName id="c-sanguozhi-012-cuiyan-qiuxu:p001:m0037" ref="i6e_n75_es1">琰</persName>死。</p>
</text>
